  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/QDRAGlOph7WuyAMPkLMxNEFj1Az9fvp6ytew3hn9IMGApnmT4Ze27rozXx3x1xU0ComxiO6p1disThunQgG414j6YeXY7WpMVNlTtXAW2VBiUnbZ0gKjS8VfXSClzq62mRHthP6REelADQ3LYjaOVe8gzRo1CtW5bqnbkoFb5Pym0JD2OmrXJSe7EnfwAxtLYAxRrzpq\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/24c7cf4bba6c469fc406412f2805bb93..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">きょうは</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ちょっとまえにアフタヌーンティーに行った時の</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おはなしをします^-^</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お友達にいっぱい写真撮ってもらったから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あげる！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/IGFI41p3MmDW5z7YAW8gURExABZCi2InNQ0JgIKWKC4wAHqRzZjm63Bs4F7CIZilW1szREKlCEYSp8IWGHgKU4Uo8oJy74FQopI21GFQTUO1ihHuye4SWpAWrCfxL4SyaIRcBnxtpRCyCn1CksF40y2Ctn5uKZDQLnjg12oaQZ8jKeC8ipbTJyQOohxYOXWXNG1pwx4A\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/f9fc56edd56af810dec1029f2a5168d9..jpg\"></a><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/lbrmJEiGcUZ2Mrc7aSa4VTK1vsxAM6hcTCj61YnUoOOsD3P6zlNemysVOS3WyPl8yAz24bE259vVAF5NBVp2MD0DQ3JD38nzyOWj1MiDXp4LPTxIIUtO0DWDbRKcU5iztO9QtZ1nGZFUWoahK2LebEpmP9Rnp11WQjfwlXhiOabFSsov2zyg9Cq3ItArPhumb0SHhtEQ\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/26d0ada0c1f63e85911be8a9f51bc5e4..jpg\"></a><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/HOLzduWwRY7UzdVKPTzDEWN58zBnmLteuBfnKQHpMcCarA1pPrUFIoBd1kCLZwX5KDKPE3LmNbB9tM5mKzkUsXA7WzyAMe84Z2bYwlyPc07Qody3dxbmA5yPrMz8dn2FOKjZUIksQVcwuQt8FC8VbhKM4z9fONWDd4iIuNAU2KdfFQUNoDNumkXehUEOcgxpaMKYGwyK\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/7f2db5abb8e288202ad563fbe42dad0e..jpg\"></a><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/LMK6DGK5dikr4Zt9HYb5F77ZlxUMDnJ2xv9znCVKqv1IURWwCDqTn39XZ7aQlassxZZ5FqMR3C7HPmaanO8mKhqqluHsJWzFORkvIuzgJ2cVUWwkcgDRF2HF9LOs0kOF2DXnvTQWKdjeSK4YgnNZGaDjxQYVSc3MtjaStZPTWTJmUpnC6LuR0xprIgGrblZQyPH3DAU7\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/0d870b1dbb89baab26a4ddcc8e7bfda0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">絶対アフタヌーンティーで撮る写真じゃないよね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ここのアフタヌーンティー本当に可愛くて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ティーポットが一人一つ自由に選べるんですけど、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">友達と私が優柔不断すぎて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">可愛い！！可愛い！やばい！！！！って言いながら</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">10分くらい迷ってたら、オーナーの方が</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱい選んじゃっていいよ！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って言ってくださったんですよ。。。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最終的に4つ選ばせていただいて、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">まじでティーパーティー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">多分人生でこんな量の紅茶一気に飲んだこと無かったと思う</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ケーキもたくさんサービスしていただきました、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ありがとうございます、、ありがとうございま、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/MKHy2ZBb2egoVcgrJKP1Nby7xPO6Vs1jDkXdwMj1LJMZg7WbM6MEtaKzNZWHHspgQj6e0lSWpBciMgJqcsDAygf38ETrvpKrFSJt1YweCCjI4V3lKErcDTGSZsK2NfnAqdNlSrLkkg60Zqz8ADWEFhkHv3NFGt0Zicvbo5hP7249csVqPKKQbr5QS0D3XHUYjdpeG5Pp\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/01b215c2725f299b5617f339395ca141..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/uEV9o9TeLxOoiO9mR1sD9PTugHoC176OgYrukDu9WLEwPslli0MFQ2n4PDRC8meaiMhmYT5R52ocIRpxVDeIZ9ObGAQBmdIBHK6MfdC89d8LJchpq2gsXBH1ltIJyLRAUSlz9x95Nnit1Cz7disprUbnlKsBnrxKJjrOf4fCBLLdjNzlQZmkU5HDNt8OFb5DYkOZ8deE\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/a406e818690571178fbc0717e8af52e6..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">美味しかったから全部のんだし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ケーキも全部食べた！(＞▽＜)／</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">わんぱくなので(＞▽＜)／</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/GOirodgwx3d0hStda0kGD2ZO8tCzsAn64CfJwRHt6EGS6oWiRUVVAh37V9yAr0x3tRzFediClCFg7c0KamouXItv2KlysT9D6ZH7mcl9qien7E0MPEgqGngbA4WoerKA80pNOOdeA7g3VBVNMi4w3GIdZWUK0aONuhx8M6F6Hmiib9ghFPdx2b1pDQGI2xoylGsXd00E\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/18537afa23c78730d41c0bd293540852..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/xefFGdygAGVNjp6Aq7k0mN8VNls6uIcGLpCWfLrvnpNlMf524iSvUwureeFa37YO98Ha9MEXR6nYksbWuHVxLkiDxdCPlk70D7H9xFLDOMb7EkiUnplSKG0hj7xr6LaTvroRekUo0uDCGWBl891IKcLnjK34B3HfkF4aQ08Xl2GpFC2pSCNO27tZ4auTkjgFWMNZo7nm\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/129e1aeff82a9ed1bdd8ab1507cded24..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">笑いすぎている</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">アフタヌーンティーで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">こんな爆笑することあるんだ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに、この子と遊ぶと笑い耐えないし、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私をいちばん可愛く撮ってくれるんです、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">数少ないお友達の1人なので、これからも変わらず</div>\n<div align=\"center\">大切にしていきたいです、、‪^_−♡</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/uvdwTMZKQXXFEjzv2ahMPkFUDxAidK2DhShkNcOIpwhlmlt01XPFBzDU2DJtNWaIGvXK2hTD1wToAe0sCDvq77l3CAOxhym56hFYSf5pXq6E5ynItuNM4SpgvpJn78A6M8PQz570YmTbkxtHT97MMy0oMQouCiJ57dBXryd1WMtlpNvy8dus41kqZlIvH8VLhDg9cr9Q\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/a83c72167c784ba08b4dfd3eda3aaf07..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">マスク外してるやつもあった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/0wShTV5DVRTq9YtfOcPdqDJgSXOorhe6k9oKZaBeGxaDhq1OUXcvJ3s3yiWkNkxkrMgvsHqu707g3muaWltqB6DGGQyCFJ8K6WPyjXnT2oZg7NvU8gFT01uuLCINImJGPkRhn41xmRSKKYdVHvc8nbVqfC4tieeg970UhHYHtAIyF7qFP3CCMnR9ZRyuprSsXwEmDqx6\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/7b966241ffd64aff9c90edb8e39843f0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これは猫解剖ごっこ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/awdRsdUD6k6dziPs317qyFPlp6umFZYEj255zgM7iegWP3MB7whBxsEfpGhXPAiS3WeY1jDu7RzabahB796T3rx3wYU7srCZBpKMsqkl7zJDbKkcLb6Bdiq5QCg50oiHzW2wQyOaN0ustuz2tbtctXtXMELUpobBmdkwvNdhtiO2ZQRJDQlYOOxStrVtxTw9Bjbp3ewT\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/19/05221ad764975ad3a2576f2c1e1841f0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これはインスタグラマーなりきりごっこ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">慣れないポーズしたから顔引き攣ってます</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center